@ingestion_service_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Upload (rota alinhada ao gateway)
POST {{ingestion_service_HostAddress}}/ingestion/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

NOTA FISCAL
Serviço R$ 100,00 em 01/01/2026
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="source"

portal
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="origin"

torre-a
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tenantId"

tenant-cond-001
------boundary--

###

GET {{ingestion_service_HostAddress}}/ingestion/health
Accept: application/json

